OL,3,GNEWSATram strikes planned until New
OL,4,AYear cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FTram strikes in Nottingham have been
OL,7,Fcancelled, operator Nottingham Express
OL,8,FTransit (NET) has confirmed.
OL,10,FThe GMB Union had planned 25 days of
OL,11,Fstrike action from Thursday to 31
OL,12,FDecember as part of an ongoing pay
OL,13,Fdispute.
OL,15,FTram staff, including drivers,
OL,16,Fticketing staff, control staff,
OL,17,Fengineers, cleaners and office workers,
OL,18,Fhad been in a dispute with NET over pay
OL,19,Fsince January.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
