OL,3,GNEWSATram strikes planned until New
OL,4,AYear cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, NET said the planned 25
OL,7,Fdays of strike action that would have
OL,8,Fimpacted services in October, November,
OL,9,Fand December had been cancelled.
